1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:00,989
Themes.

2
00:00:00,989 --> 00:00:08,828
Perception, not charity: describing people only by what they lack is itself part of what keeps them poor.

3
00:00:08,828 --> 00:00:13,815
Solidarity: richly linked in hope, one rope, one fate.

4
00:00:13,815 --> 00:00:16,223
Hope and awakening, beginning within.

5
00:00:16,223 --> 00:00:22,161
And the dignity of the poor: their work, wisdom and creativity, not our pity.

6
00:00:22,161 --> 00:00:27,526
You may apply the poem to Nepali workers abroad, but say honestly that you are applying it.

